# Pairs with ReconcilerNeverClaimsCommitted. A local revision since the base
# may be another call's, so claiming it as this call's commit asserts what the
# reconciler cannot prove.
MODULE: AuditReconcilerClaimsCommitted
TARGET: ReconcilerNeverClaimsCommitted
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the reconciler claims a commit from a local revision
PERTURBS: Reconcile

--- FIND
                     [] viewComplete /\ localSince -> "Indeterminate"
--- REPLACE
                     [] viewComplete /\ localSince -> "Committed"
--- END
